brother-td-cups (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of the CUPS driver for Brother TD-4D label printers.
  * Native CUPS raster filter with PPDs for 16 TD-4D models.
  * Die-cut and continuous media, dithering, scaling, copies, compression,
    and auto-cut/peeler support.
  * Add a PAPPL-based IPP Everywhere printer application for CUPS 3.

 -- brother-td-linux contributors <brother-td-linux@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
